---
/**
 * The honest labeling for the "Min Conduit" / "Min protocol" columns (WS4 plan
 * §1, amended AC 4.5): those values are the PUBLISHER-DECLARED minimums — a
 * floor, with no upper bound and no test evidence behind them. ConduitIO does
 * not run a compat test matrix, and this site must never read as if it did.
 *
 * Same honesty pattern as SignatureNote.astro: real, always-visible page text
 * (never a tooltip, never visually-hidden) — this is a qualification of a claim
 * the table otherwise makes silently.
 */
export const DECLARED_MINIMA_NOTE_ID = 'declared-minima-note';
---

<p id={DECLARED_MINIMA_NOTE_ID}>
  <code>Min Conduit</code> and <code>Min protocol</code> are the publisher-declared minimums — not a tested
  compatibility claim. ConduitIO has not verified them against a test matrix.
</p>
